-- Seed a useful owner-editable Sylus appearance note for the private reference library.
-- Existing owner-authored notes are preserved.
UPDATE visual_identities
SET notes = 'Canonical visual guide: Sylus is one tall adult masculine man with a refined long-oval face, defined cheekbones and tapered jaw, straight narrow nose, defined lips, strong silver brows, narrow elongated crimson eyes, and cool silver-white/platinum hair. His hair is dense, layered and feathered with a lifted textured crown, long side-swept tapered fringe, shorter temple layers and slightly longer nape pieces. Keep fine separated strands and natural flyaways. Preserve mature masculine anatomy and balanced facial proportions; never feminize him or substitute a generic white-haired red-eyed character. Wardrobe varies: fitted black shirts, tailored dark suits, long dark coats, black/burgundy leather, white or ivory open-collar shirts, waistcoats, dark knitwear, restrained straps, gloves and subtle metal jewellery; occasional orange casual overshirt. Expressions vary naturally; do not force a smirk. The right eye is associated with the Aether Core and may have a restrained red glow when power is active.'
WHERE category = 'sylus' AND COALESCE(trim(notes), '') = '';
